### Link menu to category
POST http://localhost:3000/owner/categories/link-menus
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 1
branch_id: 1
{
  "category_id": 1,
  "menu_ids": [1,2,3]
}

### Get all categories with their menus
GET http://localhost:3000/owner/categories/all/menus
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 6
branch_id: 3
